<title>USA: Marksville, La., won by J.C. Bradford.</title>
<headline>Marksville, La., won by J.C. Bradford.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.C. Bradford said it won $1.520 million of Marksville, La., sales tax bonds, Series ST-1997, with a net interest cost of 5.3964 percent.</p>
</text>
